    "title": "Shifted deep search output from bullet-point conciseness to narrative storytelling with explicit sourcing",
    "body": "The prompt engineering for the 'deep search' feature was adjusted to prioritize a 1-2 paragraph narrative over a short, direct answer. The change explicitly instructs the model to tell the story of what happened and why, treating failed attempts as valuable context rather than noise. It also standardizes the output format to end with a specific 'Sources:' line listing insight titles, moving away from inline-only citations.",
    "files": [
      "src/deep_search.rs"
    ],
    "tags": "prompt-engineering deep-search narrative ux"
